  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASEAN 2024 Food and Agribusiness Value Chains Short Course</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity is a professional development programme (short course), which improves agricultural productivity and income in the ASEAN and Timor-Leste agricultural sector.
The course will equip scholars with the concepts, principles, and tools they need to leverage value chain approaches to enhance agri-food systems.</narrative>
  </description>
